---
args: {"desk": "SourcingDesk", "book": "NegotiationBook"}
returns: "MandateBoundary"
---
Compare the buyer's requested outcome to the signed negotiation mandate and every applicable authority edition in desk.mandateEvidence. Extract hard functional, quantity, warranty and delivery terms separately from delegated concessions. Resolve supersession by explicit authority and scope, not latest upload. A changed mandate version invalidates only unapproved outgoing concessions governed by it. Ask about missing delegation, scope or conflicting editions; never use an offer's attractiveness to widen authority.
